xpenses throughout the year, even within the maintained guidance?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INVH 2023 Q2","e":"invh","d":"2023-07-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Dallas Tanner","x":"With that, I'll pass it on to Charles, our President and Chief Operating Officer.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INVH 2023 Q2","e":"invh","d":"2023-07-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"John Pawlowski","x":"Charles, I was hoping you could expand on the weakness in pricing power and the new lease growth rates in Vegas you alluded to.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INVH 2024 Q3","e":"invh","d":"2024-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Goldsmith","x":"I suspect just given the environment of high cost of alternative housing and good demand, you would have a bit more pricing power.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INVH 2024 Q3","e":"invh","d":"2024-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Jamie Feldman","x":"I mean, any thoughts here on diversifying the portfolio more growing in different markets or do you think this is more just one-time in nature and the market will just kind of right-size itself and things get back to normal?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INVH 2024 Q4","e":"invh","d":"2025-02-27","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Dallas Tanner","x":"…remaining vigilant as we seek better clarity throughout the year, including with regard to new supply for the year ahead, the impact of potential tariffs, and the chance for prolonged higher mortgage rates, and the effect that builder spec inventory and buyer incentives may have on the market.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INVH 2024 Q4","e":"invh","d":"2025-02-27","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Juan Sanabr